# The Skyranger drives during the battle. A soldier on the front tile of the cabin
# (level 1, the raised troop compartment) switches on drive mode with the Drive button
# or the drive hotkey (D), then clicks where to go: the first click previews the route,
# the second drives. Fences, bushes and trees (armor up to 30) are crushed on the way.
# It moves up to 10 tiles a turn (40 time units), whoever drives. Driven onto an alien,
# it hits it for 100 melee damage: a sectoid goes down, a muton may stop it (rammed).
crafts:
  - type: STR_SKYRANGER
    battleVehicle:
      driverSeats: [[4, 9, 1]]
      front: 0  # the nose points north; turns west by mirroring (a right click in drive mode)
      tuPerTile: 4
      timeUnits: 40
      crushArmor: 30
      runOverDamage: 100
